    "Create a dedicated workspace for Eagar with a monthly spend limit, then create a key in it that expires. Use a separate key on each device, so you can revoke one without affecting the others.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Çréáté á dédíçátéd wórkspáçé fór Éágár wíth á móñthlý spéñd límít, théñ çréáté á kéý íñ ít thát éxpírés. Úsé á sépáráté kéý óñ éáçh dévíçé, só ýóú çáñ révóké óñé wíthóút áfféçtíñg thé óthérs. ············································································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
