    "Eagar could not use the Keychain on this device. On a Mac, the app must be signed for Keychain access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár çóúld ñót úsé thé Kéýçháíñ óñ thís dévíçé. Óñ á Máç, thé ápp múst bé sígñéd fór Kéýçháíñ áççéss. ·········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar uses your own Claude API key for personal data you choose to send to Claude. College data never leaves your devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár úsés ýóúr ówñ Çláúdé ÁPÍ kéý fór pérsóñál dátá ýóú çhóósé tó séñd tó Çláúdé. Çóllégé dátá ñévér léávés ýóúr dévíçés. ·················································]"
