            "value": "[Téstíñg kéý ····]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is kept in this device's Keychain only. It is never synced, logged or exported, and is sent only to Anthropic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Thé kéý ís képt íñ thís dévíçé's Kéýçháíñ óñlý. Ít ís ñévér sýñçéd, lóggéd ór éxpórtéd, áñd ís séñt óñlý tó Áñthrópíç. ···············································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit is reached. Claude features are paused until next month or until you raise the limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Thé límít ís réáçhéd. Çláúdé féátúrés áré páúséd úñtíl ñéxt móñth ór úñtíl ýóú ráísé thé límít. ······································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local stores could not be created. Restart Eagar; if this keeps happening, check free storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Thé lóçál stórés çóúld ñót bé çréátéd. Réstárt Éágár; íf thís kééps háppéñíñg, çhéçk fréé stórágé. ·······································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test could not reach Claude. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Thé tést çóúld ñót réáçh Çláúdé. Çhéçk ýóúr çóññéçtíóñ áñd trý ágáíñ. ····························]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test sends one short fixed message to Claude Haiku 5.5 and records the call in the privacy ledger, with its exact payload and cost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Thé tést séñds óñé shórt fíxéd mésságé tó Çláúdé Háíkú 5.5 áñd réçórds thé çáll íñ thé príváçý lédgér, wíth íts éxáçt páýlóád áñd çóst. ······················································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
